title: Fully funded vs partial funding, explained
caption: "Fully funded" doesn't always mean the same thing 👀 Tuition waiver vs stipend vs fully funded vs assistantship, explained in 1 minute. Save this before you apply 📌 #scholarship #studyabroad #fullyfunded #storytime
hook: "FULLY FUNDED" CAN TRICK YOU | TOMY & QUDDUS
